      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_DEATH_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "나는, 누군가에게는 친근하며,",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "私は、誰かにとっては親しみやすく、",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 7,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_DEATH_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "누군가에게는 불쾌하다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "誰かにとっては不快だ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 8,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_DEATH_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "누군가에게는 불청객이며,",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "誰かにとっては招かれざる客であり、",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 9,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_DEATH_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "누군가에게는 귀빈이다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "誰かにとっては貴賓である。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 10,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_DEATH_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "나는 죽음. 모든 이들의 마지막을 찾아가는 자.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "私は死。すべての者の最期へと向かう者。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 11,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_DEATH_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그대에게는 내가 어떤 존재로 비치는가?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "あなたには私はどんな存在として映っているのか？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "DictionaryFinalCut": true
